 *
 * Props:
 * - id: element ID, defaults to "search-bar".
 * - action: form action, defaults to "/search/node" (Drupal core search page).
 * - param: query parameter name, defaults to "keys".
 * - placeholder: input placeholder.
 *
 * Built from the Icon button atom (submit + close) and the Svg icon atom.
 * Opened/closed by masthead.js (data-hook="search-open" / "search-close").
 */
